{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Characters with Unique Styles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a roster of characters, each with unique skills and combat styles. From shield-wielding warriors to necromancers, players can choose their preferred hero and unlock diverse combat experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/c266168a37e0641a865019554c3df5e3.avif?t=1761647270\" width=800 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/bb9cfbea655c140d8c08674aabacf1e1.poster.avif?t=1761647270\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/bb9cfbea655c140d8c08674aabacf1e1.webm?t=1761647270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/bb9cfbea655c140d8c08674aabacf1e1.mp4?t=1761647270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Boss Battles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss features unique attack patterns and mechanics that challenge the player\u2019s reflexes. Defeating a boss unlocks new abilities, further expanding combat possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/abe847ca1e1335589f3f374aad4d66e0.poster.avif?t=1761647270\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset